  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Visual style (follow exactly): in the style of Notion-style hand-drawn line illustration. Minimal hand-drawn knowledge doodle on clean white or off-white paper. Focus on one concept using simple single-weight black lines with slight hand wobble, small conceptual icons, maximum whitespace and only sparse pastel accents. Keep the composition thoughtful and orderly.",
